- PASS: `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-common --locked --test topic_validator`; `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-common --locked`; `cargo test -p rocketmq-classic-consumer --locked`; `cargo clippy -p rocketmq-classic-common -p rocketmq-classic-consumer --all-targets --all-features --locked -- -D warnings`; `cargo fmt --all -- --check`; `mvn -q -f compat/java-reference/pom.xml verify` (37 scenarios, fixture drift and Java cross-decodes); `git diff --check`.
