## TopicValidator nullable inputs and live-set members

- Rechecked pinned Java 5.5.1 behavior at `efa1be59d6fc747ad220f036c86030f05f0419f9`: `isTopicOrGroupIllegal(null)` throws `NullPointerException`; `isSystemTopic(null)` throws until null is in the live system set, then returns true; the send-block set accepts and matches null.
- Added `TopicValidatorError::NullString`, nullable adapters for the affected entrypoints, and `HashSet<Option<String>>` live sets. Added invoked Java fixture cases and Rust differential assertions. Fixture SHA-256: `33a3617cca49b8803a457b28990529abdcb2f32888d35e585138251964bcfef1`.
- Updated the Phase 6 API map, audit, Phase 16 matrix and release checklist. Broad P18-V01/P6-V04 source/API/input/reverse-export reconciliation remains open.
